{"id":"word:hebrew:H2555","type":"word","title":"חָמָס","subtitle":"H2555 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"violence ; by implication, wrong ; by metonymy unjust gain","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חָמָס (H2555) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 60 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חָמָס (châmâç) means violence ; by implication, wrong ; by metonymy unjust gain First listed occurrence: 1Chr 12 18."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חָמָס","transliteration":"châmâç","pronunciation":"khaw-mawce'","strong":"H2555","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2555","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["חָמָֽס","חָמָ֖ס","חָמָ֥ס","חָמָ֣ס","חָמָס֙"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",38],["HNcmpa",4],["HR/Ncmsc",3],["HNcmsc",3],["HR/Ncmsa",2],["HTd/Ncmsa",2],["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",2],["HC/Ncmsa",2],["HC/Ncmsc",2],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"violence ; by implication, wrong ; by metonymy unjust gain","usage":"cruel(-ty), damage, false, injustice, × oppressor, unrighteous, violence (against, done), violent (dealing), wrong.","full":"H2555. chamas חָמָס noun masculine Psa 7:17 violence, wrong — absolute ׳ח Gen 6:11 + 44 t.; construct חֲמַס Judg 9:24 7 t.; suffix חֲמָסִי Gen 16:5 ; Jer 51:35 (in both = wrong done to me ); חֲמָסוֺ Psa 7:17 ; plural חֲמָסִים 2Sam 22:49 3 t.; — violence , specifically of physical violence Judg 9:24 ; 2Sam 22:3 (not || Psa 18:3 ), Obadiah 10; Hab 1:9 ; Jer 51:35 (of Chaldeans), Hab 2:8 , 17 (twice in verse); Joel 4:19; Psa 72:14 ; but also wrong , including injurious language, harsh treatment, etc. Gen 16:5 (J, of wrong done to Sarah by, Hagar), Job 19:7 ; Mal 2:16 ; in General of rude wickedness of men, their noisy, wild, ruthlessness Micah 6:12 ; Hab 1:2 ; Zeph 1:9 ; Prov 10:6 , 11 ; 13:2 ; 26:6 + Ezek 7:11 (si vera lectio, see Co), || שֹׁד Amos 3:10 ; Hab 1:3 ; Jer 6:7 ; 20:8 ; Ezek 45:9 ; Isa 60:18 , || רִיב Psa 55:10 , || עָמָל 7:17 , || גַּאֲוָה 73:6 , ח ׳אֹהֵב 11:5 (|| רָשָׁע ), denied, of servant of ׳י Isa 53:9 , ׳ח בארץ Jer 51:46 , compare Gen 6:11 , 13 (P), Ezek 8:17 ; 12:19 ; ח נְאוֺת ׳מַחֲשַׁכֵּיאֶֿרֶץ מָֽלְאוּ Psa 74:20 , ח מָֽלְאָה ׳הָעִיר Ezek 7:23 ; 28:16 , ח ׳שֶׁבֶת Amos 6:3 is (probably) enthronement of violence ; ח ׳כְּלֵי Gen 49:5 (poem) instrument, weapons, of violence ; — other phrases are: ׳ח בְּיָדַיִם Jonah 3:8 ; 1Chr 12:17 , compare Job 16:17 , ׳ח יְדֵיכֶם Psa 58:3 and ח ׳מֹּעַל בְּכַמֵּיהֶם Isa 59:6 ; ח ׳עֵד i.e. a witness that promotes violence and wrong Exod 23:1 (JE), Deut 19:16 , ח ׳עֵדֵי Psa 35:11 ; חָמָס וִיפֵהַ שֶׁקֶר עֵדֵי 27:12 ; ח ׳שׂנאת 25:19 +? violence; חָמָס אִישׁ = violent man 18:49 ( 2Sam 22:49 has the later ׳א חמסים , compare below) Psa 140:12 ; Prov 3:31 ; 16:29 ; חמסים אישׁ (later) Psa 140:2 ; 140:5 ; 2Sam 22:49 ; חֲמָסִים יֵין Prov 4:17 i.e. wine gained by violence (|| רֶשַׁע לֶחֶם ).","rootNote":"from 2554 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 12 18","keyReferences":["1Chr 12 18","2Sam 22 3","2Sam 22 49","Amos 3 10","Amos 6 3","Deut 19 16","Exod 23 1","Ezek 7 11"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":60,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 12 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָמָס֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 3","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵ/חָמָ֖ס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 22 49","book":"2Sam","chapter":22,"verse":49,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמָסִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"Amos 3 10","book":"Amos","chapter":3,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָמָ֥ס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Amos 6 3","book":"Amos","chapter":6,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָמָֽס","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 19 16","book":"D